{"id":"posibilidad","lemma":"posibilidad","pos":"noun","rank":1011,"glosses":["possibility","means","potential, chance, odds, opportunity"],"ipa":"/posibiliˈdad/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"posibilidades"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/14/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-posibilidad.wav","examples":[{"text":"Es una posibilidad, ¿no?","en":"That's a possibility, isn't it?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/538337","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"no / not"}]},{"text":"Tenemos pocas posibilidades de ganar.","en":"We have little chance of winning.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/353786","words":[{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"little, not much","l":"poco"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"to gain"}]},{"text":"Hay otra posibilidad.","en":"There's another possibility.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/582074","words":[{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},{"g":"someone else","l":"otro"},null]},{"text":"Sólo hay tres posibilidades.","en":"There are only three possibilities.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/456711","words":[null,{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},{"g":"three"},null]},{"text":"No tenía otra posibilidad, sino sólo hacerlo.","en":"You had no choice but to do it.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/585925","words":[{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"someone else","l":"otro"},null,{"g":"but"},null,{"g":"to do","l":"hacer"}]}]}